usage: expand.py [-h] [--base-snapshot BASE_SNAPSHOT] [--target TARGET]
                 [--candidate-cache CANDIDATE_CACHE] --work-dir WORK_DIR
                 [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE] [--proxy PROXY]
                 [--backend {api,sparql}] [--output-dir OUTPUT_DIR]
                 [--model-dir MODEL_DIR] [--base-splits BASE_SPLITS]
                 [--activate]

Extend a frozen movie snapshot using cached Wikidata truthy SPARQL facts.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --base-snapshot BASE_SNAPSHOT
  --target TARGET
  --candidate-cache CANDIDATE_CACHE
  --work-dir WORK_DIR
  --batch-size BATCH_SIZE
  --proxy PROXY         Optional HTTP proxy, e.g. htt<private-path>
  --backend {api,sparql}
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
                        New isolated processed-data directory.
  --model-dir MODEL_DIR
                        New isolated A0 model directory; requires --output-
                        dir.
  --base-splits BASE_SPLITS
                        Optional original splits.json to preserve film
                        assignments.
  --activate            Use the completed paired A0 dataset/model in the
                        browser UI.
